{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"2CO","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"哥林多後書","commonName":"哥林多後書","title":"哥林多後書","order":47,"numberOfChapters":13,"sha256":"f297e7cfa4910241c0e35d15ccb43e89472533d18c1c1d26ea8e8954d955ffee","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/2CO/1.json","lastChapterNumber":13,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/2CO/13.json","totalNumberOfVerses":255},"chapter":{"number":6,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["身為上帝的同工，我們勸你們不要辜負祂的恩典。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["因為祂說：",{"text":"「在悅納的時候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我應允了你；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在拯救的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我幫助了你。」","poem":1},{"noteId":2},"看啊，現在正是悅納的時候！看啊，現在正是拯救的日子！"]},{"type":"heading","content":["上帝僕人的品格"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["為了避免有人毀謗我們的職分，我們凡事儘量不妨礙別人，"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["反倒在任何事上都顯明自己是上帝的僕人。不論遭遇什麼患難、艱苦、貧窮、"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["鞭打、囚禁、暴亂、辛勞、無眠或饑餓，我們都堅忍到底，"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["靠著純潔、知識、忍耐、仁慈、聖靈的感動、無偽的愛心、"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["真理之道、上帝的大能、左右手中的公義兵器，"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["無論是得榮耀還是受羞辱，遭毀謗還是得稱讚，都顯明自己是上帝的僕人。我們被視為騙子，卻是誠實無偽；"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["似乎默默無聞，卻是家喻戶曉；似乎快死了，看啊！我們卻仍然活著；受嚴刑拷打，卻沒有喪命；"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["似乎鬱鬱寡歡，卻常常喜樂；似乎一貧如洗，卻使多人富足；似乎一無所有，卻樣樣都有！"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["哥林多人啊！我們對你們推心置腹，開誠佈公，"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["毫無保留，只是你們自己心胸狹窄。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["現在請你們也向我們敞開心懷。我這樣說，是把你們當成自己的兒女。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["永活上帝的殿"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["不要和非信徒同負一軛，因為公義和不法怎能合作呢？光明和黑暗怎能共存呢？"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["基督與魔鬼",{"noteId":3},"怎能相容呢？信徒與非信徒有什麼相干呢？"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["上帝的殿與偶像怎能相提並論呢？因為我們就是永活上帝的殿，正如上帝說：",{"text":"「我要住在他們中間，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在他們當中往來；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要作他們的上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們要作我的子民。」","poem":1},{"noteId":4}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["主又說：",{"text":"「所以，你們要從他們中間出來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"離開他們，不要沾染污穢之物，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我就接納你們。","poem":1},{"noteId":5}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要作你們的父親，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要作我的兒女。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是全能的主說的。」","poem":1},{"noteId":6}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":2,"caller":"+","text":"以賽亞書49·8。","reference":{"chapter":6,"verse":2}},{"noteId":3,"caller":"+","text":"「魔鬼」希臘文是「彼列」。","reference":{"chapter":6,"verse":15}},{"noteId":4,"caller":"+","text":"利未記26·12；耶利米書32·38；以西結書37·27。","reference":{"chapter":6,"verse":16}},{"noteId":5,"caller":"+","text":"以賽亞書52·11；以西結書20·34、41。","reference":{"chapter":6,"verse":17}},{"noteId":6,"caller":"+","text":"撒母耳記下7·14；7·8。","reference":{"chapter":6,"verse":18}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/2CO/6.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/2CO/7.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/2CO/5.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":18}